方面的功能\r\n\r\nhttps://www.jetbrains.com/idea/", "content_rendered": "都是 AI 方面的功能<br /><br /><a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://www.jetbrains.com/idea/\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\">https://www.jetbrains.com/idea/</a>", "last_modified": 1793925098, "replies": 69, "id": 1254865}, {"node": {"avatar_large": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/navatar/ccb0/9896/755_large.png?m=1402729057", "name": "libido", "avatar_normal": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/navatar/ccb0/9896/755_normal.png?m=1402729057", "title": "情感问题", "url": "https://www.v2ex.com/go/libido", "topics": 1791, "footer": "", "header": "有些事情不必一直憋在心里，说出来让大家听听，然后一起想办法吧。", "title_alternative": "Libido", "avatar_mini": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/navatar/ccb0/9896/755_mini.png?m=1402729057", "stars": 979, "founder_id": 0, "aliases": [], "root": false, "id": 755, "parent_node_name": "life"}, "member": {"id": 130918, "username": "dumbass", "url": "https://www.v2ex.com/u/dumbass", "website": "", "twitter": "", "psn": "", "github": "", "btc": "", "location": "", "tagline": "", "bio": "", "avatar_mini": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/93f3/ada6/130918_mini.png?m=1793929783", "avatar_normal": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/93f3/ada6/130918_normal.png?m=1793929783", "avatar_large": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/93f3/ada6/130918_large.png?m=1793929783", "avatar_xlarge": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/93f3/ada6/130918_xlarge.png?m=1793929783", "avatar_xxlarge": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/93f3/ada6/130918_xxlarge.png?m=1793929783", "avatar_xxxlarge": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/93f3/ada6/130918_xxxlarge.png?m=1793929783", "created": 1438774026, "last_modified": 1793929783, "pro": 0}, "last_reply_by": "gamelyking", "last_touched": 1793972813, "title": "二狗匹配对象突然删好友加拉黑", "url": "https://www.v2ex.com/t/1254892", "created": 1793929827, "deleted": 0, "content": "上周四在二狗上互相心动匹配到一个女生，她先主动打的招呼，后续也是顺理成章加了微信。\r\n\r\n这几天有一搭没一搭聊着，昨晚下班后还互动了几句，吃晚饭的时候打开主页意外发现自己被删除了好友同时拉黑。\r\n\r\n脑瓜子嗡嗡的，感觉自己被厌恶了😭，一夜没睡好，很想找个说法。\r\n\r\n> 一开始她告诉我的名字甚至都是假的，还是看她朋友圈才发现真名，问起来被打个哈哈糊弄过去了。", "content_rendered": "<p>上周四在二狗上互相心动匹配到一个女生，她先主动打的招呼，后续也是顺理成章加了微信。</p>\n<p>这几天有一搭没一搭聊着，昨晚下班后还互动了几句，吃晚饭的时候打开主页意外发现自己被删除了好友同时拉黑。</p>\n<p>脑瓜子嗡嗡的，感觉自己被厌恶了😭，一夜没睡好，很想找个说法。</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>一开始她告诉我的名字甚至都是假的，还是看她朋友圈才发现真名，问起来被打个哈哈糊弄过去了。</p>\n</blockquote>\n", "last_modified": 1793929827, "replies": 67, "id": 1254892}, {"node": {"avatar_large": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/navatar/2a9d/121c/912_large.png?m=1582188474", "name": "jetbrains", "avatar_normal": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/navatar/2a9d/121c/912_normal.png?m=1582188474", "title": "JetBrains", "url": "https://www.v2ex.com/go/jetbrains", "topics": 716, "footer": "", "header": "Development tools for professionals and teams", "title_alternative": "JetBrains", "avatar_mini": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/navatar/2a9d/121c/912_mini.png?m=1582188474", "stars": 463, "founder_id": 0, "aliases": [], "root": false, "id": 912, "parent_node_name": "programmer"}, "member": {"id": 481564, "username": "programMrxu", "url": "https://www.v2ex.com/u/programMrxu", "website": "", "twitter": null, "psn": null, "github": null, "btc": null, "location": "", "tagline": "", "bio": "", "avatar_mini": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/3681/f0ad/481564_mini.png?m=1735196118", "avatar_normal": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/3681/f0ad/481564_normal.png?m=1735196118", "avatar_large": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/3681/f0ad/481564_large.png?m=1735196118", "created": 1585980605, "last_modified": 1735196118, "pro": 0}, "last_reply_by": "maolon", "last_touched": 1793973214, "title": "jetbrains 好像已经亏损了。ai 冲击好大啊", "url": "https://www.v2ex.com/t/1254870", "created": 1793926491, "deleted": 0, "content": "", "content_rendered": "", "last_modified": 1793926491, "replies": 63, "id": 1254870}]